Add the tested Fujitsu BCM5703C PCI identities to tg3. This applies on
vanilla v7.3-rc1 and is separate from the M3000 BCM5718 byte-order fix.
Earlier PRIMEPOWER tests covered automatic binding and packet transfers.

The exact cleaned integration booted PRIMEPOWER UP/SMP with automatic
tg3 binding. Hash-checked PCI#01 transfers passed on CPU0 and CPU1,
including close/reopen and return to CPU0. Tests used the integrated
stack; final transfer qualification was on PCI#01.

